msgstr "rasimu — ukurasa wa Turath umepatikana; uhakiki wa kielimu na uchapishaji unasubiriwa"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "draft — scholarly and publication review pending"
msgstr "rasimu — uhakiki wa kielimu na uchapishaji unasubiriwa"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah provided another kind of help. He tended sheep and brought them near after nightfall, making milk available. The account describes this on each of the three nights."
msgstr "‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah alitoa msaada wa aina nyingine. Alichunga kondoo na kuwaleta karibu baada ya giza kuingia, na kufanya maziwa kupatikana. Simulizi inaeleza hili kwa kila usiku katika masiku hayo matatu."

