#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Leaving Makkah"
msgstr "Kuondoka Makkah"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Night of 27 Safar · 12–13 September 622"
msgstr "Usiku wa tarehe 27 Safar · 12–13 Septemba 622"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The night of departure is in the accounts. Its place in the calendar is a modern reckoning."
msgstr "Usiku wa kuondoka umo katika simulizi. Nafasi yake katika kalenda ni makadirio ya sasa."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The nights before Friday, Saturday and Sunday"
msgstr "Usiku wa kuamkia Ijumaa, Jumamosi na Jumapili"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Three nights is in al-Bukhari. Naming them after the days of the week follows a modern reckoning."
msgstr "Usiku mitatu imo katika al-Bukhari. Kuzitaja kwa majina ya siku za wiki hufuata makadirio ya sasa."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The guide arrives"
msgstr "Kiongozi anawasili"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Night of Monday, 1 Rabi‘ al-Awwal · 16 September 622"
msgstr "Usiku wa kuamkia Jumatatu, 1 Rabi‘ al-Awwal · 16 Septemba 622"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The guide came with the two mounts after the third night, as arranged. The calendar date is a modern reckoning."
msgstr "Kiongozi alikuja na wanyama wawili wa kupanda baada ya usiku wa tatu, kama ilivyopangwa. Tarehe ya kalenda ni makadirio ya sasa."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "On the coastal road"
msgstr "Kwenye barabara ya pwani"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "About a week"
msgstr "Karibu wiki moja"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The accounts give the order of what happened on the road, but no days. The pursuit and the tent of Umm Ma‘bad fall somewhere in this week."
msgstr "Simulizi zinatoa mpangilio wa yaliyotokea njiani, lakini hakuna siku zilizotajwa. Kufuatwa njiani na hema la Umm Ma‘bad vilitokea wakati fulani katika wiki hii."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Arrival at Quba"
msgstr "Kuwasili Quba"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Monday · 8 Rabi‘ al-Awwal · 23 September 622"
msgstr "Jumatatu · 8 Rabi‘ al-Awwal · 23 Septemba 622"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The account in al-Bukhari says it was a Monday in Rabi‘ al-Awwal. The day of the month is a modern reckoning."
msgstr "Simulizi katika al-Bukhari inasema ilikuwa Jumatatu katika mwezi wa Rabi‘ al-Awwal. Tarehe ya mwezi huo ni makadirio ya kisasa."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The stay at Quba"
msgstr "Kukaa Quba"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Four days, or more than ten nights"
msgstr "Siku nne, au zaidi ya usiku kumi"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Ishaq gives Monday to Thursday. The report in al-Bukhari says more than ten nights, and Banu ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf said eighteen. Ibn Kathir sets the reports side by side without settling it."
msgstr "Ibn Ishaq anataja Jumatatu hadi Alhamisi. Ripoti katika al-Bukhari inasema zaidi ya usiku kumi, na Banu ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf walisema kumi na nane. Ibn Kathir anaweka ripoti hizi kando kwa kando bila kuamua."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The first Friday, and Madinah"
msgstr "Ijumaa ya kwanza, na Madinah"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Friday · 12 Rabi‘ al-Awwal · 27 September 622"
msgstr "Ijumaa · 12 Rabi‘ al-Awwal · 27 Septemba 622"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "That it was a Friday is in the early reports. The calendar date is a modern reckoning, and it follows the four-day stay."
msgstr "Kwamba ilikuwa Ijumaa imetajwa katika ripoti za mapema. Tarehe ya kalenda ni makadirio ya kisasa, na inafuatia ukaaji wa siku nne."

