#: src/content/first-chapter.js
msgid "In Ibn Ishaq’s account, “as it reached me,” ‘Ali stayed behind for another reason too. People in Makkah had left their valuables with the Prophet ﷺ for safekeeping, knowing his honesty; the report says ‘Ali was to return their deposits."
msgstr "Katika simulizi la Ibn Ishaq, kwa maneno “kama nilivyofikiwa na habari”, Ali alibaki nyuma kwa sababu nyingine pia. Watu wa Makka walikuwa wakimwachia Mtume ﷺ mali zao azitunze kwa sababu walijua uaminifu wake; simulizi hilo linasema Ali angewarudishia amana zao."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
msgid "Further on they stopped at the tent of Umm Ma‘bad of Khuza‘ah and asked for hospitality. She said they had no food and no milk-giving ewe."
msgstr "Baadaye njiani walisimama kwenye hema la Umm Ma‘bad wa kabila la Khuza‘a na kuomba ukarimu. Alisema hawakuwa na chakula wala kondoo jike anayetoa maziwa."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
msgid "The report says the Prophet ﷺ called for one of her sheep, passed his hand over its udder and called on Allah. He milked it into a large vessel until it frothed, and said: drink, Umm Ma‘bad. Ibn Kathir notes that her story is well known and comes through routes that strengthen one another."
msgstr "Simulizi linasema Mtume ﷺ aliomba aletwe mmoja wa kondoo wake, akapapasa kiwele chake kwa mkono na kumuomba Allah. Akamkamua ndani ya chombo kikubwa hadi maziwa yakatoa povu, akasema: “Kunywa, Umm Ma‘bad.” Ibn Kathir anataja kuwa kisa chake kinajulikana na kimesimuliwa kwa njia za mapokezi zinazotiana nguvu."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
msgid "According to ‘Urwa, he stayed among them for a few more than ten nights. There he founded the mosque that the account calls the one founded on piety, and he prayed in it."
msgstr "Kwa mujibu wa simulizi la ‘Urwa, alikaa nao kwa usiku zaidi ya kumi kwa kiasi cha usiku chache. Huko aliujenga msikiti ambao simulizi linautaja kuwa umejengwa juu ya uchamungu, na akaswali ndani yake."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
msgid "They stopped at Umm Ma‘bad’s tent. She said they had no food or milk-giving ewe; the report then describes milk from one of her sheep."
msgstr "Walisimama kwenye hema la Umm Ma‘bad. Alisema hawakuwa na chakula wala kondoo jike anayetoa maziwa; kisha simulizi linaeleza kukamuliwa kwa mmoja wa kondoo wake."

