#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "What’s inside"
msgstr "Yaliyomo ndani"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "<0>Gathered from the sources.</0> Passages on the Hijrah were collected from the classical Arabic works on Turath, among them Ibn Hisham’s Sirah, Sahih al-Bukhari, Sahih Muslim, al-Bayhaqi’s Dala’il al-Nubuwwa and Ibn Kathir."
msgstr "<0>Imekusanywa kutoka kwenye vyanzo.</0> Dondoo kuhusu Hijrah zilikusanywa kutoka kwenye kazi za asili za Kiarabu za Turath, miongoni mwazo zikiwa Sirah ya Ibn Hisham, Sahih al-Bukhari, Sahih Muslim, Dala’il al-Nubuwwa ya al-Bayhaqi, na Ibn Kathir."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "<0>One Arabic core.</0> The events were set out as records and claims, each tied to the passages that support it. Everything the app says comes from this core."
msgstr "<0>Kiini kimoja cha Kiarabu.</0> Matukio yalipangwa kama rekodi na madai, kila moja likiwa limefungamana na dondoo zinazolithibitisha. Kila kitu kinachoelezwa kwenye programu hii kinatoka kwenye kiini hiki."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "<0>Translated from the Arabic.</0> The other languages are translated directly from the Arabic, not through English."
msgstr "<0>Imetafsiriwa kutoka Kiarabu.</0> Lugha nyingine zimetafsiriwa moja kwa moja kutoka Kiarabu, si kupitia Kiingereza."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "<0>Practice from the same evidence.</0> Questions are built on the same claims and passages, so every answer can be checked against its source."
msgstr "<0>Mazoezi kutoka kwenye ushahidi uleule.</0> Maswali yamejengwa juu ya madai na dondoo zilezile, ili kila jibu liweze kuhakikiwa dhidi ya chanzo chake."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "<0>Drawn with care.</0> The terrain is real; places and routes are schematic. People are never shown, and animals appear without riders."
msgstr "<0>Imechorwa kwa uangalifu.</0> Mandhari ya eneo ni halisi; maeneo na njia vimechorwa kimchoro. Watu hawaonyeshwi kamwe, na wanyama huonekana bila wapandaji."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "<0>AI, guided by the sources.</0> AI tools helped draft, translate and voice the narration, always working from the Arabic sources."
msgstr "<0>AI, ikiongozwa na vyanzo.</0> Zana za AI zilisaidia kuandaa rasimu, kutafsiri na kusimulia kwa sauti, zikifanya kazi daima kutoka kwenye vyanzo vya Kiarabu."

