#: src/content/text.generated.js
msgid "Then the guide came with the camels, as arranged, and ‘Amir left his flock to go with them. The four set out: the Prophet ﷺ, Abu Bakr with ‘Amir behind him, and the guide, down along the coast, “by the edge of the sea.”"
msgstr "Kisha mwongoza njia akaja na ngamia kama ilivyopangwa, na ‘Amir akaacha kundi lake la kondoo ili aungane nao. Watu hao wanne wakaanza safari: Mtume ﷺ, Abu Bakr akiwa amempandisha ‘Amir nyuma yake, na mwongoza njia, wakifuata pwani, “karibu na ukingo wa bahari.”"

#: src/lib/scene-manifest.js
